    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brainrot: Story of Glorbo Frutodrillo &amp; Ballerino Cappuccino is a 2D atmospheric visual novel, blending absurdity, paranoia, and mild unease into everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Glorbofrutodrila \u2014 a creature who moves into a new home with his pregnant wife, hoping for peace and a fresh start. But soon, cracks begin to show \u2014 both in the walls and in reality. Neighbors whisper, the floor creaks, and one early morning phone call might change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching dialogue and meaningful decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorable characters reacting to your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn art in a unique visual style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle ambient music and immersive sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story where nothing is accidental</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a horror game. It's a tale of suspicion, strange timing, and the feeling that you're not in full control.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brainrot: Story of Glorbo Frutodrillo &amp; Ballerino Cappuccino is a 2D atmospheric visual novel, blending absurdity, paranoia, and mild unease into everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Glorbofrutodrila \u2014 a creature who moves into a new home with his pregnant wife, hoping for peace and a fresh start. But soon, cracks begin to show \u2014 both in the walls and in reality. Neighbors whisper, the floor creaks, and one early morning phone call might change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching dialogue and meaningful decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorable characters reacting to your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn art in a unique visual style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle ambient music and immersive sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story where nothing is accidental</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a horror game. It's a tale of suspicion, strange timing, and the feeling that you're not in full control.</p>",
    "short_description": "Life seemed simple... until the cracks appeared. Dive into absurdity, intrigue, and uncanny coincidences in a visual novel where nothing happens by chance.",
